  "severity_bands": {
    "_comment": "FIN priority at Marsa runs 50..250 and HIGHER means MORE severe: 250 is control-engine FD&D rule output, 50-150 is connector chatter. That is the opposite of the Haystack default, so 'order' declares the direction. With order=desc the values below are inclusive LOWER bounds (>=250 critical, >=150 warning, else info); with order=asc they are inclusive UPPER bounds (<=critical, <=warning, else info).",
